      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{63ec9430d19f4344f2992df7|full_name} Rather than forced to stay, could just be a quick prompt when a player tries to leave that there is unsaved progress and if they would like to save before leaving, but still free to leave anytime",
